<title>GERMANY: Mannesmann Arcor plans no bourse listing.</title>
<headline>Mannesmann Arcor plans no bourse listing.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The newly-named Mannesmann Arcor telecommunications joint venture between German engineering group Mannesmann AG and German railways Deutsche Bahn plans no bourse listing, an Arcor official told a news briefing on Thursday.</p>
<p>The official said that the fact that Mannesmann was already listed meant that a separate issue was not necessary.</p>
<p>Mannesmann earlier confirmed U.S. phone giant AT&amp;T Co and the Unisource European telecom venture as additional partners in Arcor.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
